(LOVE LETTER - Demo Rulebook \(Board Game Cafe\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(OVERVIEW) Tj T*
(Players try to deliver a love letter to the princess. Each player holds one card; the) Tj T*
(card with the highest value at the end of a round, or being the last player in the) Tj T*
(round, wins a token.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SETUP) Tj T*
(Shuffle the deck and remove the top card face down. With 2 players, also remove 3) Tj T*
(cards face up. Deal 1 card to each player.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(YOUR TURN) Tj T*
(Draw a card, then play one of your 2 cards face up and apply its effect.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(CARDS \(VALUE, COUNT\)) Tj T*
(- Spy \(0, 2\): no effect when played. At the end of the round, if you are the only) Tj T*
(   player who played) Tj T*
(or discarded a Spy, you gain a token.) Tj T*
(- Guard \(1, 6\): name a card other than Guard; if the chosen player has it, they are) Tj T*
(   out.) Tj T*
(- Priest \(2, 2\): look at another player's hand.) Tj T*
(- Baron \(3, 2\): compare hands with another player; the lower value is out.) Tj T*
(- Handmaid \(4, 2\): you are protected until your next turn.) Tj T*
ET
