(CARDS \(CONTINUED\)) Tj T*
(- Prince \(5, 2\): choose any player, yourself included, to discard their card and draw) Tj T*
(   a new one.) Tj T*
(- Chancellor \(6, 2\): draw 2 cards, keep 1 of your 3 cards and put 2 at the bottom of) Tj T*
(   the deck.) Tj T*
(- King \(7, 1\): trade hands with another player.) Tj T*
(- Countess \(8, 1\): if you also hold the King or a Prince, you must play the Countess.) Tj T*
(- Princess \(9, 1\): if you play or discard it, you are out of the round.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(END OF A ROUND) Tj T*
(The round ends when only one player is left, or when the deck is empty: then the) Tj T*
(remaining players reveal their cards and the highest value wins the round. The winner) Tj T*
(gains a token.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(WINNING THE GAME) Tj T*
(Tokens needed to win: 6 with 2 players, 5 with 3 players, 4 with 4 players, 3 with 5) Tj T*
(or 6 players.) Tj T*
